                        FORM OF THE RAT
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'Of all the creatures, there is only one who has such power,
yet is so despised.'|WK0 - |RKBMaster Shal Wei
|YK0
The Rat, a creature of shadow and speed. A Monk can utilise
a fighting form based upon the skills associated with
such a creature. 

This form unlocks several powers which can ONLY be used
while in the form of the Rat.

These powers are: |GKBRats Fury|YK0, |GKBRats Scurry|YK0, |GKBRats Strike|YK0, |GKBEvaluate|YK0
and |GKBFlip|YK0.
|YK0
